ared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345760/extras/bc02be5e638ef45b7f8c9af01a2373d6.webm?t=1768229725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345760/extras/4d8f0c48418f6b962245b6a7d8e4ea69.webp?t=1768229725\" width=19 height=19 /></span> Dominate the court as a tennis professional</h2> Matchpoint – Tennis Championships features 16 real-life international tennis stars from the professional circuit, like <strong>Nick Kyrgios, Kei Nishikori or Amanda Anisimova</strong>, including their gear from brands such as <strong>Nike, Yonex, Babolat</strong> and many more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345760/extras/4d8f0c48418f6b962245b6a7d8e4ea69.webp?t=1768229725\" width=19 height=19 /></span> Study your rival’s moves and tactics</h2>Watch your opponents and get to know their <strong>strengths and weaknesses</strong> to gain a tactical advantage before you even hit the court.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345760/extras/4d8f0c48418f6b962245b6a7d8e4ea69.webp?t=1768229725\" width=19 height=19 /></span> Practice makes perfect</h2>Hire a <strong>personal coach</strong> to hone your skills. Buff your strengths and diminish your weaknesses with an <strong>in-game coaching system of individual training modules</strong>.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345760/extras/24981402982c66bb2122bf1dd8257388.poster.avif?t=1768229725\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13